0a
-- Co-op patch: the Xbox 360's RibbonToyBox screen script (launch disc, decompiled with unluac), the console
-- Toy Box build ribbon, in place of the PC's keyboard rework. The exe opens it
-- for a player on a pad and for both players in split screen (coop.c, coop_ribbon_name_hook); keyboard and mouse
-- in single player keep the PC's touch ribbon (iOS_RibbonToyBox). One change from the 360: the PC has no console
-- full-screen movie (its Infinitorium is the keyboard rework), so every layout uses the split movie Infinitorium_V.
.
